AI-assisted English translation edited by David McDougall

This edition is free to use, reproduce, adapt and redistribute, including
commercially, under the licences of its components:

| Component | Licence | Principal locations |
|---|---|---|
| Established Italian text | CC0 1.0 Universal | `corpus/`, `sources/normalized/` |
| English translation | CC BY 4.0, where rights subsist | `translations/` |
| Editorial commentary and apparatus | CC BY 4.0, where rights subsist | `annotations/`, `apparatus/`, `decisions.md`, `translation-drafts/` |
| Research and provenance data; documentation | CC0 1.0 Universal | `sources/` (except witnesses), `links/`, `decisions/`, root documents |
